                <pb facs="0842" n="836" sameAs="frus:frus1942v03/pg836"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">860H.00/1421<hi rendition="#superscript">6/8</hi>
                </note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum of Conversation, by the Secretary of
                        State</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1942-12-28">December 28, 1942</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Yugloslav Ambassador called and renewed his request for a statement to be
                    issued in support of General Mihailovich.</p>
                <p>I replied, as I had stated to him on his previous visit for this purpose, that
                    the Department had taken the matter up sympathetically and I hoped to see a
                    statement issued through some source within another day or two that would be in
                    line with our original position, as expressed while his King was in this
                    country.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>C[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ordell</hi>] H[<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >ull</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
